      "content": "English: Ha-Chephirim | French: Kefirim | Latin: Cephirim | Origin: &#64315;&#1456;&#1508;&#1460;&#1497;&#1512;&#1460;&#1497;&#1501; | Vietnamese: Cơ-phi-rim -- Nkm 6,2",
